  "remediated_issues": [
    "1. Managed credential validation (validate_private_path & WindowsDPAPITokenStorage) accepts LIVE manifest when Settings is live while preserving fail-closed rejection for paper settings.",
    "2. deployment/windows/common.ps1 Assert-SwiftManifest accepts LIVE manifests and Set-SwiftEnvironment configures LIVE environment with Set-SwiftLiveEnvironment helper.",
    "3. deployment/windows/service.ps1 and manage.ps1 support RegisterLiveTask and UnregisterLiveTask actions for SwiftAutoTrader-Live-Local.",
    "4. scripts/pin_account.py implemented and packaged along with pin_agentic_account DPAPI helper and swift-autotrader pin-account CLI.",
    "5. Windows installation procedure corrected to use setup.ps1 from checkout to managed install directory rather than invalid Git operations inside managed root.",
    "6. live-dispatch --once accurately classified as an active execution cycle, clearly distinguished from read-only mcp-diagnostics --connect.",
    "7. Windows scheduled live service updated to launch multi-worker supervisor (dashboard, telegram, live-dispatch) concurrently rather than live-dispatch alone.",
    "8. Windows setup.ps1 and manage.ps1 updated to initialize and migrate isolated production journal (data/live.sqlite3) alongside paper journal.",
    "9. Dashboard and analytics updated to recognize and safely report LIVE mode status without secret leakage.",
    "10. Comprehensive integrated service acceptance rehearsal suite (tests/integration/test_complete_service_integration.py) covering dual DB isolation, live dispatch cycle, dashboard reporting, supervisor multi-worker lifecycle, crash recovery, circuit breaker, clean shutdown, and PowerShell deployment invariants."
